  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Monochromatic light of wavelength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"600\"></span> nm is incident on a double slit. The separation of the slits is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.0\"></span> mm. An interference pattern is formed on a screen that is at a distance of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.5\"></span> m from the slits. What is the distance between the central maximum and the first minimum in the pattern? </p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"15\"></span> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mu\"></span>m</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"30\"></span> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mu\"></span>m</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"150\"></span> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mu\"></span>m</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"300\"></span> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mu\"></span>m</li>\n</ol>"
